# BuildOS. What is built, and what must never be committed.

target/
.DS_Store
*.swp
*~

# Local-only. A real job carries client names, quantities and prices; none of it is anyone
# else's business and none of it is needed to build or check this program. Anything placed in
# refs/ is sanitized first (CLAUDE.md, "Patrick's fixed rules").
fixtures/
refs/
evidence/
work/
out/

# A window demonstration writes its pictures here for whoever runs it to read. They are not
# kept: what is shown is the manual (plumbline/manual/), one picture to a task, replaced in
# place (plumbline/DECISIONS.md call 237).
plumbline/demos/captured/
